00:14:23,907 --> 00:14:24,740
- [Nayland] Thank you, Curt.

411
00:14:24,740 --> 00:14:25,722
It was very kind of you to come.

412
00:14:25,722 --> 00:14:26,555
- [Joel] Well, I didn't mean to,

413
00:14:26,555 --> 00:14:28,126
