414
00:14:28,126 --> 00:14:29,709
- [Servo] Joel, no!

415
00:14:31,093 --> 00:14:34,820
- [Kessler] Fish aren't
biting well today, Petrie, uh?

416
00:14:34,820 --> 00:14:36,876
- Everybody can't be an Isaac Walton.

417
00:14:36,876 --> 00:14:39,039
- [Crow] Don't wave your
little sizzler at me, dad.

418
00:14:39,039 --> 00:14:39,872
- Not yet.

419
00:14:39,872 --> 00:14:40,705
(laughs)

420
00:14:40,705 --> 00:14:42,578
- Somebody may be joining
you on the London train.

421
00:14:42,578 --> 00:14:45,785
- I'm here for the old gringo audition.

422
00:14:45,785 --> 00:14:46,706
- [Servo] Sounds like he had a little shot

423
00:14:46,706 --> 00:14:48,508
