455
00:15:48,970 --> 00:15:50,874
- [Voiceover] This is Fu Manchu.

456
00:15:50,874 --> 00:15:52,195
- [Servo] And I'm an alcoholic.

457
00:15:52,195 --> 00:15:53,028
- [Joel] Hi, Fu!

458
00:15:53,028 --> 00:15:53,996
- [Voiceover] In the Caribbean Sea --

459
00:15:53,996 --> 00:15:55,157
