weapon that I possess.

462
00:15:58,914 --> 00:15:59,782
- [Crow] Hello?

463
00:15:59,782 --> 00:16:01,365
Hey, lights please!

464
00:16:02,816 --> 00:16:04,405
- [Joel] You know, it
kind of looks like a Nova

465
00:16:04,405 --> 00:16:06,968
