466
00:16:06,968 --> 00:16:08,218
- [Servo] Yeah.

467
00:16:11,604 --> 00:16:12,485
- [Joel] Focus!

468
00:16:12,485 --> 00:16:14,141
- [Servo] Somethin'.

469
00:16:14,141 --> 00:16:15,141
We're green!

470
00:16:15,996 --> 00:16:17,281
They're green.

471
00:16:17,281 --> 00:16:18,114
Hmm?

472
00:16:18,114 --> 00:16:18,947
Not again.

473
00:16:20,739 --> 00:16:23,322
