476
00:16:31,180 --> 00:16:34,384
but unless the heads of
state of the major powers --

477
00:16:34,384 --> 00:16:36,467
- [Joel] Looks like Fu
shops at Ethan Allen.

478
00:16:36,467 --> 00:16:37,300
