479
00:16:37,300 --> 00:16:38,136
- [Servo] Tasteful.

480
00:16:38,136 --> 00:16:42,756
- [Voiceover] In 14 days
from now, I shall strike.

481
00:16:42,756 --> 00:16:43,971
