484
00:16:49,017 --> 00:16:50,313
We'll catch you on the flip flop.

485
00:16:50,313 --> 00:16:51,407
Catch you later, good buddy.

486
00:16:51,407 --> 00:16:52,569
HT at 10 four.

487
00:16:52,569 --> 00:16:54,078
- Fu Manchu hasn't lost his cunning.

488
00:16:54,078 --> 00:16:58,003
