transmitters, impossible to trace.

489
00:16:58,003 --> 00:17:01,314
He's threatened mankind with obliteration.

490
00:17:01,314 --> 00:17:04,345
It sounded almost biblical.

491
00:17:04,345 --> 00:17:05,293
- [Man] That's one book in which

492
00:17:05,293 --> 00:17:07,456
