493
00:17:07,456 --> 00:17:08,289
- [Crow] Quite.

494
00:17:08,289 --> 00:17:09,835
- I was thinking of the flood.

495
00:17:09,835 --> 00:17:11,954
In some way, Fu Manchu's new weapon

496
00:17:11,954 --> 00:17:14,468
involves water and its temperature.

497
00:17:14,468 --> 00:17:15,763
- Staring contest on the left.

498
00:17:15,763 --> 00:17:16,596
Check it out.

499
00:17:16,596 --> 00:17:17,512
- [Servo] You blinked.

500
00:17:17,512 --> 00:17:19,101
- In a spot where he could control

501
00:17:19,101 --> 00:17:21,091
great quantities of water.

502
00:17:21,091 --> 00:17:23,091
Panama, Gibraltar, Suez.

503
00:17:24,215 --> 00:17:25,550
- [Servo] Ruby Falls.

504
00:17:25,550 --> 00:17:26,383
- Or even Istanbul.

505
00:17:26,383 --> 00:17:27,953
