506
00:17:27,953 --> 00:17:28,834
The Opa Dells.

507
00:17:28,834 --> 00:17:31,668
- Ooh, let's go there now.

508
00:17:31,668 --> 00:17:32,501
- [Joel] Oh, sure.

509
00:17:32,501 --> 00:17:33,777
