510
00:17:33,777 --> 00:17:34,610
- [Crow] No!

511
00:17:34,610 --> 00:17:35,443
- [Servo] Oh, that's terrible!.

512
00:17:35,443 --> 00:17:36,276
- [Joel] Well, it's not Constantinople.

513
00:17:36,276 --> 00:17:37,359
- [Crow] Uh-uh.

514
00:17:37,359 --> 00:17:38,317
♫ Istanbul is Constantinople

515
00:17:38,317 --> 00:17:42,150
♫ Istanbul ♫

