2046
01:16:50,449 --> 01:16:52,974
- [Joel] It's Evening At
The Improv with Fu Manchu.

2047
01:16:52,974 --> 01:16:55,005
- You are an obstinate man.

2048
01:16:55,005 --> 01:16:56,422
- Thank you, sir.

2049
01:16:59,766 --> 01:17:01,725
- How highly do you value your life,

2050
