compared with that of Nayland Smith.

2051
01:17:03,582 --> 01:17:04,415
- Try me.

2052
01:17:05,617 --> 01:17:07,826
- [Joel] Let's crack the party ball, man.

2053
01:17:07,826 --> 01:17:10,362
- The entrance to eternity --

2054
01:17:10,362 --> 01:17:12,122
- [Servo] That's bigger
than I thought it would be.

2055
01:17:12,122 --> 01:17:15,224
- [Fu Manchu] Which leads
directly to the sea.

2056
01:17:15,224 --> 01:17:18,054
Systems of water are poised above it.

2057
01:17:18,054 --> 01:17:19,694
A touch of a lever will release hundreds,

2058
01:17:19,694 --> 01:17:21,726
of thousands of gallons of water --

2059
01:17:21,726 --> 01:17:22,559
- [Servo] Do it.

2060
01:17:22,559 --> 01:17:25,891
- Combined with Professor
Heracles' crystals,

2061
01:17:25,891 --> 01:17:28,793
this can transform the entire sea,

2062
01:17:28,793 --> 01:17:31,623
