2066
01:17:41,579 --> 01:17:42,612
(sighs)

2067
01:17:42,612 --> 01:17:44,862
- [Joel] It's Mrs. Sawfull.

2068
01:17:47,865 --> 01:17:48,948
Chairman, Ow!

2069
01:17:51,830 --> 01:17:54,805
- Inside the Comic Mind with Fu Manchu.

2070
01:17:54,805 --> 01:17:56,880
- Where is Nayland Smith?

2071
01:17:56,880 --> 01:17:58,201
- [Joel] Who is Nayland Smith?

2072
01:17:58,201 --> 01:18:00,618
- If you'll free me and Lisa.

2073
01:18:02,830 --> 01:18:05,055
- When we find her.

2074
01:18:05,055 --> 01:18:07,871
- [Servo] But right now,
she's doing a blackout sketch.

2075
01:18:07,871 --> 01:18:11,804
- My men are camped in the
park, four kilometers from here.

2076
01:18:11,804 --> 01:18:14,329
- He's about to become a pencil neck geek.

2077
01:18:14,329 --> 01:18:15,162
- [Servo] Uh-oh.

2078
01:18:15,162 --> 01:18:16,114
- [Omar] Nayland Smith is with them.

2079
01:18:16,114 --> 01:18:19,875
- [Joel] He's really gonna needle him.

2080
01:18:19,875 --> 01:18:20,708
(groans)

2081
01:18:20,708 --> 01:18:23,924
Oh, wait, he wasn't done yet.

2082
01:18:23,924 --> 01:18:24,882
(groans)

2083
01:18:24,882 --> 01:18:26,549
- I had Jello today.

2084
01:18:27,654 --> 01:18:28,743
- [Servo] Oh, his gums are bleeding.

2085
01:18:28,743 --> 01:18:31,326
He doesn't floss much, does he?

2086
01:18:34,170 --> 01:18:37,250
- Next week, on The Castle of Fu Manchu.

2087
01:18:37,250 --> 01:18:39,180
- [Joel] Stop doing that.

2088
01:18:39,180 --> 01:18:40,013
- Sorry.

2089
01:18:43,133 --> 01:18:45,356
- [Joel] They trying to sneak up on us?

2090
01:18:45,356 --> 01:18:47,750
- Hey, just drop the
ball, and take a stroke.

2091
01:18:47,750 --> 01:18:48,795
- [Servo] For cryin' out loud.

2092
01:18:48,795 --> 01:18:51,669
- They'll never find it in that rough.

2093
01:18:51,669 --> 01:18:53,004
- [Joel] They're snipe hunting.

2094
01:18:53,004 --> 01:18:53,837
Snipe!

2095
01:18:55,369 --> 01:18:57,452
- [Servo] At Hazeltine's.

2096
01:18:59,622 --> 01:19:03,789
You, you get in the house,
you're embarrassing me.

2097
01:19:06,254 --> 01:19:09,113
- It's like the ninja
version of Days of Heaven.

2098
01:19:09,113 --> 01:19:11,196
(laughs)

2099
01:19:12,480 --> 01:19:14,053
(explosion)

2100
01:19:14,053 --> 01:19:16,688
- [Servo] Ooh, stock footage.

2101
01:19:16,688 --> 01:19:20,438
Oh, old, vile jelly,
where is thy luster now?

2102
01:19:22,987 --> 01:19:23,820
Oedipus.

2103
01:19:23,820 --> 01:19:26,513
- [Joel] Burt Young's
wardrobe by Victoria's Secret.

2104
01:19:26,513 --> 01:19:27,877
- [Ingrid] He's awake.

2105
01:19:27,877 --> 01:19:28,710
- [Servo] Where'd you come from?

2106
01:19:28,710 --> 01:19:30,649
I thought they killed you.

2107
01:19:30,649 --> 01:19:31,999
- How you feeling now?

2108
01:19:31,999 --> 01:19:33,610
- I feel like a hundred bucks.

2109
01:19:33,610 --> 01:19:36,890
- I feel nothing, but I am alive.

2110
01:19:36,890 --> 01:19:38,965
- [Fu Manchu] You wish to
remain alive, Professor?

2111
01:19:38,965 --> 01:19:40,677
- [Joel] Oh, geez, not him again.

2112
01:19:40,677 --> 01:19:42,593
He can suck the air out of any room.

2113
01:19:42,593 --> 01:19:44,593
(sighs)

2114
01:19:45,902 --> 01:19:46,903
- You will see that he stays

2115
01:19:46,903 --> 01:19:50,139
conscious for a few more minutes.

2116
01:19:50,139 --> 01:19:52,331
- [Lin Tang] Father, the
attack was successful.

2117
01:19:52,331 --> 01:19:55,103
Omar Pasha's men were all destroyed.

2118
01:19:55,103 --> 01:19:56,728
- [Servo] Man, your face
could launch a thousand ships.

2119
01:19:56,728 --> 01:19:58,803
- And Nayland Smith?

2120
01:19:58,803 --> 01:19:59,660
- [Lin Tang] Dead.

2121
01:19:59,660 --> 01:20:01,660
This man saw him killed.

2122
01:20:03,273 --> 01:20:06,103
- I shall broadcast at midnight.

2123
01:20:06,103 --> 01:20:06,936
- [Joel] On the King Biscuit Flower Hour.

2124
01:20:06,936 --> 01:20:08,068
- And Heracles?

2125
01:20:08,068 --> 01:20:09,896
- He will talk.

2126
01:20:09,896 --> 01:20:11,261
You have explained to him,

2127
01:20:11,261 --> 01:20:14,012
the information I require from him?

2128
01:20:14,012 --> 01:20:15,266
- Yes, of course.

2129
01:20:15,266 --> 01:20:16,383
- [Servo] Yes, yes, information, yes.

2130
01:20:16,383 --> 01:20:19,883
- Your task is now completed, Dr. Kessler.

2131
01:20:21,419 --> 01:20:22,943
- [Servo] These guys.

2132
01:20:22,943 --> 01:20:24,193
Come on, dummy.

2133
01:20:30,156 --> 01:20:32,239
- And how are we feeling?

2134
01:20:34,002 --> 01:20:36,991
- [Joel] Go to bed, old man.

2135
01:20:36,991 --> 01:20:39,074
- The formula, Professor.

2136
01:20:39,952 --> 01:20:40,785
- No.

2137
01:20:44,204 --> 01:20:46,236
- [Servo] Hmm, didn't count on that.

2138
01:20:46,236 --> 01:20:48,151
- Castle of Fu Manchu
will be back, after this.

2139
01:20:48,151 --> 01:20:48,984
- [Joel] That's enough.

2140
01:20:48,984 --> 01:20:49,817
- Huh?

2141
01:20:49,817 --> 01:20:50,650
What?

2142
01:20:50,650 --> 01:20:51,483
- [Joel] Don't do that
anymore, I'm sick of it.

2143
01:20:51,483 --> 01:20:53,715
- [Servo] Welcome to Swing
Back with Jazzbo Collins.

2144
01:20:53,715 --> 01:20:55,515
- It's hot in here!

2145
01:20:55,515 --> 01:20:57,329
- Then take your clothes off.

2146
01:20:57,329 --> 01:20:58,162
- [Joel] Say!

2147
01:20:58,162 --> 01:21:00,579
- A gentleman never takes
his clothes off in public!

2148
01:21:00,579 --> 01:21:01,566
- [Joel] Well, you're no gentleman,

2149
01:21:01,566 --> 01:21:03,076
and we're in private!

2150
01:21:03,076 --> 01:21:03,909
- Oh, yes, so we are.

2151
01:21:03,909 --> 01:21:06,143
(mumbling)

2152
01:21:06,143 --> 01:21:08,310
- [Joel] Fez headed, blah.

2153
01:21:10,192 --> 01:21:12,359
(humming)

2154
01:21:14,299 --> 01:21:15,954
- Hey, it's Waldo!

2155
01:21:15,954 --> 01:21:18,871
They found Waldo, they found Waldo.

2156
01:21:19,727 --> 01:21:20,844
- Yes, indeed.

2157
01:21:20,844 --> 01:21:22,745
- [Servo] My imitation of a lawnmower.

2158
01:21:22,745 --> 01:21:25,594
(coughs)

2159
01:21:25,594 --> 01:21:28,306
- [Crow] That was smooth.

2160
01:21:28,306 --> 01:21:30,306
(yells)

2161
01:21:33,487 --> 01:21:35,272
- [Voiceover] This is my ultimatum.

2162
01:21:35,272 --> 01:21:36,105
Within the next few hours --

2163
01:21:36,105 --> 01:21:36,973
- [Servo] Hot tomato?

2164
01:21:36,973 --> 01:21:39,426
- [Voiceover] The
Bosphorus, and to the city

2165
01:21:39,426 --> 01:21:42,169
of Istanbul, will be destroyed.

2166
01:21:42,169 --> 01:21:45,028
- It's not true, it can't be true!

2167
01:21:45,028 --> 01:21:46,148
- Dr. Petrie --

2168
01:21:46,148 --> 01:21:47,544
- Dr. Peepee?

2169
01:21:47,544 --> 01:21:48,377
- [Both] Petrie.

2170
01:21:48,377 --> 01:21:49,360
- Oh.
- [Joel] Dish.

2171
01:21:49,360 --> 01:21:51,116
- [Voiceover] Nayland Smith.

2172
01:21:51,116 --> 01:21:53,279
Nayland Smith is dead.

2173
01:21:53,279 --> 01:21:55,267
- [Servo] Long live Nayland Smith.

2174
01:21:55,267 --> 01:21:57,558
- [Joel] He's dead.

2175
