Hey, she reached level three
of Super Mario Brothers.

2176
01:22:01,205 --> 01:22:03,372
(humming)

2177
01:22:05,109 --> 01:22:06,619
- [Man] Master.

2178
01:22:06,619 --> 01:22:08,273
